This archive contains an AnsiWall script with the following features:

ANSI Only - due to the fact that ANSI codes are used throughout

Propper brick stucture produced by using IBM characters

Colours all fine :)

Ability to use cursor keys to move around the wall before deciding where
to put your comment (checks to see that comment won't overrun screen!

Choose the colour you want your text written in (multicoloured available!)

Compressed for speed

Nice ANSI graphics

Easy to use - with instructions

Easy to wipe the screen - Sysop (or person with enough access) just needs
to press the "/" key and it will do it.

Can easily be fitted into a logon/logoff menu - or both!

Easy to setup three line config file!

Shareware - but not crippleware

Use cursor keys to choose which colour you want - very easy to use!
 
Users will love it!